# 2026-09-02

## What I Did
* Continued the structural optimization and CAD modeling of the GelSight-style tactile sensor enclosure (V2).
* Modeled the main body as a 90 × 90 × 90 mm enclosure with dual functional chambers separated by an integrated 5 mm mid-plate (50 mm upper dark box and 35 mm lower camera cavity).
* Defined and updated hole tolerances across the structure to account for FDM 3D printing thermal shrinkage, standardizing M2.5 clearance holes to Φ3.2 mm and the central camera lens opening to Φ26 mm.
